      storyTitleArabic: "مناظرة جامعية",
      paragraphs: <String>["A debating society prepared a motion about mandatory lecture attendance at lectures. The opening speaker argued that regular participation improved learning, while the opposing team questioned whether physical presence guaranteed attention.", "Before the debate, students examined the underlying assumption in each argument. They distinguished a supporting reason from an isolated anecdote and asked which attendance figures could fairly support a general claim.", "During the rebuttal round, Salma acknowledged a valid objection concerning students with caring responsibilities. She proposed a flexible exception rather than treating every absence as a lack of commitment.", "The judging panel praised her balanced conclusion and accurate use of evidence. Although her team did not win every point, the final discussion showed that intellectual honesty could strengthen an argument instead of weakening it."],
