      paragraphs: <String>["A historic neighborhood welcomed more visitors after a popular travel documentary. The tourism board celebrated visitor spending, but residents reported rental pressure and crowded streets during the peak season.", "A local craft cooperative proposed guided visits that supported working artisans. Members worried that a simplified cultural performance might attract customers while misrepresenting the traditions that gave their work meaning.", "The council discussed a visitor management plan with resident representatives. Options included group-size limits, clearer quiet hours, and a tourism contribution to maintaining public spaces used by both visitors and residents.", "The final pilot protected a residential lane from large tour groups. A monitoring report would compare economic benefits with daily-life impacts, recognizing that successful tourism depended on the community remaining a place to live."],
