      storyTitleArabic: "انتخابات الأفكار",
      paragraphs: <String>["A civic forum invited three teams to propose improvements to the town center. Each policy platform included a public benefit, an estimated cost, and a suggested implementation period.", "Before the public vote, a fact-checking group examined the budget assumptions. One proposal relied on an unconfirmed grant, while another underestimated the staffing requirement for evening activities.", "During a deliberation session, participants ranked priorities rather than simply defending their favorite team. A revised option combined better lighting with a smaller community programme that could operate within existing resources.", "The winning proposal received conditional approval and a review date. Organizers published the voting summary alongside the unresolved funding question, showing that public support was a starting point for responsible implementation rather than proof that every detail was settled."],
      storyWords: <EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("civic forum", "منتدى مدني"), EnglishAdvancedWord("policy platform", "برنامج سياسات"), EnglishAdvancedWord("estimated cost", "تكلفة مقدرة"), EnglishAdvancedWord("implementation period", "فترة التنفيذ"), EnglishAdvancedWord("public vote", "تصويت عام"), EnglishAdvancedWord("fact-checking group", "مجموعة تحقق"), EnglishAdvancedWord("budget assumptions", "افتراضات الميزانية"), EnglishAdvancedWord("unconfirmed grant", "منحة غير مؤكدة"), EnglishAdvancedWord("staffing requirement", "احتياج الموظفين"), EnglishAdvancedWord("deliberation session", "جلسة مداولة"), EnglishAdvancedWord("revised option", "خيار معدل"), EnglishAdvancedWord("conditional approval", "موافقة مشروطة"), EnglishAdvancedWord("review date", "تاريخ المراجعة"), EnglishAdvancedWord("voting summary", "ملخص التصويت")],
