      grammarExamples: <String>["They asked whether the grant was confirmed.", "She asked how the project would be staffed.", "Residents asked why the cost had increased."],
      listening: "Tonight's forum will compare three proposals before participants rank their preferences. Please consider the likely benefits, costs, and practical conditions of each option. A proposal may receive strong support while still requiring further work on funding or staffing. After the vote, the organizing group will publish the ranking and explain the conditions attached to the selected project. We will not describe a popular idea as fully funded unless the money has been confirmed. The review session next month will allow participants to see whether those conditions have been met.",
